## SQ-IMS-01
@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `[itemMerges]`
@pass `1 pack merges registered` at startup (woods join after); in the recipe event `pack: 93 merges, N recipes swapped` then `creativedelight: 14 merges, N recipes swapped`, each once; no `already merged`, `already ran`, `chains with` line; no `Error occurred while handling event` from an `item_merges.js`
@fails A group logged twice: the guard keyed on `e.hashCode()` failed; `replaceItems is not a function`: the old Creative Common jar is in `mods/`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# item_merges.js logs through the startup console; both KubeJS logs are read so the row does not depend on which
shell grep -h "\[itemMerges\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200
shell grep -qE "\[itemMerges\] [0-9]+ pack merges registered" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
shell test "$(cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -cE '\[itemMerges\] pack: [0-9]+ merges, [0-9]+ recipes swapped')" = 1
shell test "$(cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -cE '\[itemMerges\] creativedelight: [0-9]+ merges, [0-9]+ recipes swapped')" = 1
shell ! cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -E "\[itemMerges\] .*(already merged|already ran|chains with)"
bootreject Error occurred while handling event.*item_merges|replaceItems is not a function
look the pack and creativedelight merge counts (93 and 14 in the 2026-10-27 build; later merges raise them) and the pack-merges-registered count against item_merges.md
## SQ-IMS-02
@group A
@commands Time the recipe event: `RecipeManager` / KubeJS `recipes` lines in latest.log, against the 2026-10-27 perf eval (12.2 s KubeJS recipe events)
@pass Shorter by several seconds
@fails Not shorter: JFR the recipe event (`perf.md` 3) and look for `replaceItems`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell grep -hiE "recipe.*(took|in) [0-9.]+ ?m?s|Posted .*recipe|recipes? event" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | cut -c1-200 | tail -8; true
look the KubeJS recipe event time against the 2026-10-27 perf eval (12.2 s): shorter by several seconds (a measurement: the runner records the line)
## SQ-IMS-03
@group A
@commands `/mgcore`; `/fdtest coffee`; `/reload`, then both again
@pass Same PASS lines as SQ-MG-10 and SQ-CO-01 before the split (banana, milk bottle, chocolate cake, diced potatoes, rocky dirt, coffee recipes and loot); after `/reload` the same, and the two `[itemMerges]` recipe lines once each
@fails A recipe still names a purged id: `/recipescan` and check which group the pair is in (pack recipes added after priority -100, or CD recipes naming a pack pair)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> mgcore
waitlog \[mgcore\] done \d+ pass 180
> fdtest coffee
waitlog \[fdtest\] done coffee: 180
> reload
waitlog Added [0-9]+ recipes 180
sleep 5
shell test "$(grep -cE '\[itemMerges\] pack: [0-9]+ merges' logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | awk -F: '{s+=$NF} END{print s}')" -ge 1
> mgcore
> fdtest coffee
sleep 60
count \[mgcore\] done \d+ pass, 0 fail >= 2
count \[fdtest\] done coffee: \d+ pass, 0 fail >= 2
reject \[(mgcore|fdtest)\] FAIL
look after the /reload the two [itemMerges] recipe lines (pack, creativedelight) show once each in logs/kubejs/server.log
## SQ-IMS-04
@group A
@commands `/recipescan` (recipe_scan.js), grep `[jeiRemove]` for every purged id (banana, milk bottle, chocolate cake, diced potatoes, rocky dirt, the 7 coffee ids, pickled pickles, The Salt's salt, Vintage's salt block, a river wood id)
@pass No recipe names a purged id; Gambler's Tea and the chocolate cake cutting recipe now under `creativedelight:`
@fails A purged id left: the pair's group never ran (CD jar missing or member gate)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> recipescan
sleep 20
shell grep -h "\[jeiRemove\]" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | tail -30; true
> cdevtest makes alexsmobs:banana
> cdevtest makes neapolitan:milk_bottle
