@@text Results 2026-10-27 night (overall run, Creative Delight 17:20 then 18:43): SQ-IMS-01 PASS (`pack: 93 merges, 2 recipes swapped`, `creativedelight: 14 merges, 29 recipes swapped`, once per load, no guard lines or errors). SQ-IMS-02 PASS: recipe event 2.7 s (`wgp_new` 9.7 s), `/reload` 9-10 s (28 s). SQ-IMS-03 PASS: `/fdtest coffee` 19/0; `/mgcore` 33/0 after its stale rows were updated (merge count, 4-bottle milk recipes, cake id), the same after `/reload`. SQ-IMS-04 FAIL (salt pair only): `vintagedelight:salt_block` input of 3 Vintage froglight fermenting recipes, `vintagedelight:salt_bucket` output of `tactical_fishing:fishing_vintagedelight_salt_bucket`; no other purged id (see SQ-SALT-01).
